e  government we've got now is to the right  of bolsonaro and to the right of the  fascist government we've got in Italy I  mean if people have to wake up and see  what's happening  the public order bill will be put to MPS  next week it also proposes jailing  protesters who glue themselves to roads  for up to six months it's a penalty lots  of activists would be willing to face  leaving many asking why the government  is going ahead with it Becky Cottrell  Sky News
 

